        "file": "example.com.zone",
        "lang": "text",
        "kind": "secure",
        "code": "$ORIGIN example.com.\n$TTL 3600\n\n@         IN  A      203.0.113.10\nwww       IN  CNAME  example.com.\n@         IN  MX     10 mail.example.com.\nmail      IN  A      203.0.113.25\n\n; SPF: only our mail server may send, everything else must be rejected (\"-all\")\n@         IN  TXT    \"v=spf1 ip4:203.0.113.25 -all\"\n\n; DMARC: receivers must reject messages that fail SPF/DKIM, and send us reports\n_dmarc    IN  TXT    \"v=DMARC1; p=reject; rua=mailto:dmarc-reports@example.com\"\n\n; CAA: only Let's Encrypt may issue TLS certificates for this domain\n@         IN  CAA    0 issue \"letsencrypt.org\"\n\n; The dangling \"old-shop\" alias was deleted together with the cloud resource\n",
